What I want to know is how likely is it that you will receive something with this issue, since I’m not convinced it’s all cards (I need to see some other reviews). Perhaps a more cognisant course of action would be to seek support for what appears to be a defective unit (hardware or driver) like a consumer would if performance tanked. Get confirmation from AMD and make sure you review the product everyone else is getting; or you are not reviewing “the card” and horribly misrepresenting. 

But he did say he thinks his drivers will not be the same as general consumers. At the minute I’m going for 3080 side of life... This crap is putting me off.

